WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
1. Log in. The university internship coordinator creates your student account and assigns your academic group.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
2. Explore opportunities. Review the requirements and submit your application.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
3. The company supervisor reviews your application and accepts or rejects it.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
4. Confirm one accepted offer to create your placement. Other outstanding applications become Not selected.
